<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Accompanying works include supplements, concordances, indexes, catalogues, teacher’s guides, music for a motion picture, etc. (Deprecated)"@en .
