<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10061> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Creation of a new work by paraphrasing, rewriting, or adapting works by another creator, if the modification has substantially changed the nature and content of the original or changed the medium of expression, is included."@en .
