<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to a corporate body who is an artist who is responsible for calligraphy where the focus of interest lies in the aesthetic value of the penmanship or graphic artistry, regardless of whether the same corporate body is also responsible for the inscribed text."@en .
