<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A metadata description set includes a bibliography of works, expressions, or manifestations, a directory of agents and places, and an analytic finding aid."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10055> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/seeAlso> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20048> .
