<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10055> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "有编纂者行为者"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "将一种作品与负责创建一个元数据描述集的一个行为者关联起来。"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10055> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "编纂者行为者"@zh-Hans-CN .
