<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10437> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to a person who is responsible for creating a work."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10437> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "creator person of work"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10437> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A person who is responsible for creating a work."@en .
