<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Kinooperatoru mēdz saukt arī par galveno operatoru."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10415> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "有摄影指导个人"@zh-Hans-CN .
