<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10057> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/interviewerAgentOfWork.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10057> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "interviewer agent of work"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10057> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An agent who is responsible for creating a work by acting as an interviewer, reporter, pollster, or some other kind of agent who gathers information."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10057> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "agent intervieweur d’une œuvre"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10057> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Agent qui est responsable de la création d’une œuvre en agissant à titre d’intervieweur, de reporteur, de sondeur ou d’autre agent qui recueille de l’information."@fr .
