<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has cadenza work"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to a work that is a musical work that is an ornamental passage for a soloist added to a musical work, such as a concerto, by the same or a different composer."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
