<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ha come cadenza opera"@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Correla un’opera a un’opera musicale che consiste di un abbellimento per solista, aggiunta a un'opera musicale, come per esempio un concerto, dello stesso compositore o di uno diverso."@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "cadenza opera"@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Opera musicale che consiste di un abbellimento per solista, aggiunta a un'opera musicale, come per esempio un concerto, dello stesso compositore o di uno diverso."@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "darbs: kadence"@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sasaista darbu ar mūzikas darbu, kas ir solistam komponēta ornamentāla pasāža, kas pievienota citam muzikas darbam, piemēram, koncertam, kas ir vai nu tā paša, vai cita komponista radīts."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "darbs: kadence"@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Mūzikas darbs, kas ir solistam komponēta ornamentāla pasāža, kas pievienota citam muzikas darbam, piemēram, koncertam, kas ir vai nu tā paša, vai cita komponista radīts."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10026> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "有华彩作品"@zh-Hans-CN .
