<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to a work that is a musical work, such as a concerto, to which is added a musical work that is an ornamental passage for a soloist by the same or a different composer."@en .
