<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "libretist (tegija)"@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Seostab teose tegijaga, kes on muusikalise või koreograafilise lavateose (nt ooper, ballett) või oratooriumi sõnade autor."@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Ei hõlma üksnes muusikali laulusõnade kirjutamist."@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "libretist"@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "libretist (tegija)"@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Tegija, kes on muusikalise või koreograafilise lavateose (nt ooper, ballett) või oratooriumi sõnade autor."@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "librettista:"@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ha come librettista agente "@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Correla un’opera a un agente autore delle parole di un’opera musicale o coreografica come un’opera,  balletto o altro tipo di opera per il teatro musicale, o un oratorio."@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E' esclusa la creazione delle parole  delle sole canzoni di un musical."@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "librettista"@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "librettista agente "@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Agente autore delle parole di un’opera musicale o coreografica come un’opera, balletto o altro tipo di opera per il teatro musicale, o un oratorio."@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "librettiste"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "libretists (aģents)"@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sasaista darbu ar aģentu, kas ir teksta autors mūzikas vai horeogrāfiskam darbam, piemēram, operai, baletam, citam muzikālam skatuves darbam vai oratorijai."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "libretists (aģents)"@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Aģents, kas ir teksta autors mūzikas vai horeogrāfiskam darbam, piemēram, operai, baletam, citam muzikālam skatuves darbam vai oratorijai."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Neietver atsevišķu dziesmu tekstus mūziklos."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Librettist"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "台本作者"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "有台本作者行为者"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "将一种作品与作为歌剧、芭蕾或其他舞台音乐作品或者清唱剧等音乐或编舞作品的词的著者的一个行为者关联起来。"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "台本作者行为者"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "作为歌剧、芭蕾或其他舞台音乐作品或者清唱剧等音乐或编舞作品的词的著者的一个行为者"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "不包括音乐剧中只是歌曲的词著者。"@zh-Hans-CN .
