<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10204> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to an agent who is an author of the words of a popular song, including a song from a musical."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10204> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
