<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10204> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/lyricistAgent.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10204> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "lyricist agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10204> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An agent who is an author of the words of a popular song, including a song from a musical."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10204> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "agent parolier"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10204> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Agent auteur des paroles d’une chanson populaire, y compris une chanson d’une comédie musicale."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10204> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "agente letrista"@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10204> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Un agente que es autor de la letra de una canción popular, incluida una canción de un musical."@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10204> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Authoring of only the dialogue from a musical is excluded."@en .
