<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10028> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is modified by variation as work"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10028> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to a work that is a musical work in which melodic, thematic, or harmonic material taken from another work forms a discrete theme, which is repeated one or more times with subsequent modifications."@en .
