<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10064> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has producer agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to an agent responsible for most of the business aspects of a production for screen, sound recording, television, webcast, etc."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10064> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A producer is generally responsible for fundraising, managing the production, hiring key personnel, arranging for distributors, etc."@en .
