<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is separated into work"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to a work that is a diachronic work that continues the partial content of another diachronic work that is continuing."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10001> .
