<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/separatedIntoWork.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "separated into work"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A work that is a diachronic work that continues the partial content of another diachronic work that is continuing."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "continué en partie par une œuvre"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Œuvre diachronique qui continue le contenu partiel d’une autre œuvre diachronique qui se poursuit."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "separada en obra"@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Una obra que es una obra diacrónica que continua el contenido parcial de otra obra diacrónica que continua."@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/w/P10104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This element applies in general to a successive work."@en .
